ting and family reunions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-toronto-performer-who-discovered-through-a-2022-dna-test-that-he-had-at-least-15-half-siblings-and-later-found-20-more-turned-his-family-secret-into-a-musical-seven-siblings-from-the-us-have-now-surprised-him-at-a-show-in-canada/articleshow/135797401.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-toronto-performer-who-discovered-through-a-2022-dna-test-that-he-had-at-least-15-half-siblings-and-later-found-20-more-turned-his-family-secret-into-a-musical-seven-siblings-from-the-us-have-now-surprised-him-at-a-show-in-canada/articleshow/135797401.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T21:10:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135797519,imgsize-923315.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Martin Luther King Jr’s historic speech draft heads to auction]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135773589.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A handwritten draft of Martin Luther King Jr's iconic 1963 speech will be auctioned at Christie's in January 2027. This manuscript, the only known handwritten final draft, includes significant edits made by King himself. The auction will benefit several charities, including the Xernona Clayton Foundation and The King Center. The draft will be publicly displayed starting January 15, 2027, before the auction.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1963-martin-luther-king-jr-wrote-seven-pages-for-his-historic-i-have-a-dream-washington-speech-decades-later-the-manuscript-was-rediscovered-in-an-aides-desk-drawer-and-could-fetch-more-than-10-million-at-auction/articleshow/135773589.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1963-martin-luther-king-jr-wrote-seven-pages-for-his-historic-i-have-a-dream-washington-speech-decades-later-the-manuscript-was-rediscovered-in-an-aides-desk-drawer-and-could-fetch-more-than-10-million-at-auction/articleshow/135773589.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T21:10:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135773778,imgsize-247488.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Two new Amazon howler monkey species found after 84 years; camera traps capture bridge crossing]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135835272.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Scientists have identified two previously unknown howler monkey species in the Amazon rainforest through genetic research, 84 years after the last new species was described. The study highlights the region’s hidden biodiversity and the threat posed by deforestation. Separately, camera traps captured a newly identified Mato Grosso red howler monkey crossing an artificial canopy bridge designed to reconnect fragmented forest habitats.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/two-new-howler-monkey-species-discovered-in-amazon-rainforest-after-84-years-camera-traps-capture-newly-identified-primate-crossing-wildlife-bridge-genetic-study-flags-deforestation-threat/articleshow/135835272.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/two-new-howler-monkey-species-discovered-in-amazon-rainforest-after-84-years-camera-traps-capture-newly-identified-primate-crossing-wildlife-bridge-genetic-study-flags-deforestation-threat/articleshow/135835272.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T21:10:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpe