e><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135790616.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Inspired by the kindness of a washerwoman, Ted Turner pledged a remarkable $1 billion to the United Nations, paving the way for the creation of the United Nations Foundation. This significant support culminated in an additional $3 billion in funds for essential global causes. Turner's philanthropic spirit has left an indelible mark, motivating countless individuals to engage in positive change and champion worldwide cooperation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1997-ted-turner-heard-how-a-mississippi-washerwoman-gave-150000-of-her-savings-for-scholarships-and-pledged-1-billion-to-support-un-causes-his-daughter-now-says-another-3-billion-followed/articleshow/135790616.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1997-ted-turner-heard-how-a-mississippi-washerwoman-gave-150000-of-her-savings-for-scholarships-and-pledged-1-billion-to-support-un-causes-his-daughter-now-says-another-3-billion-followed/articleshow/135790616.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T20:02:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135790744,imgsize-80192.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Pat Cummins’ $905,000 Moss Vale investment bought in 2017 sells for $1.16 million after eight months]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135831282.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Australian cricket captain Pat Cummins and wife Rebecca have sold their Moss Vale investment property for an estimated $1.16 million after eight months on the market. The couple bought the 1920s three-bedroom bungalow for $905,000 in 2017. Previously rented for around $550 a week, the property sits on a sprawling 2,327-square-metre block in the Southern Highlands.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/pat-cummins-and-wife-rebecca-bought-their-moss-vale-investment-property-for-905000-in-2017-rented-it-out-for-550-a-week-now-selling-it-for-1-16-million-after-eight-months-on-the-market/articleshow/135831282.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/pat-cummins-and-wife-rebecca-bought-their-moss-vale-investment-property-for-905000-in-2017-rented-it-out-for-550-a-week-now-selling-it-for-1-16-million-after-eight-months-on-the-market/articleshow/135831282.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T20:02:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135831468,imgsize-127177.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump, Xi, Putin meet next week: Why fears of a 'Yalta 2.0' are growing]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135834931.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-xi-putin-meet-next-week-why-the-1945-yalta-conference-is-back-in-focus/articleshow/135834931.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-xi-putin-meet-next-week-why-the-1945-yalta-conference-is-back-in-focus/articleshow/135834931.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T19:59:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135835397,imgsize-82959.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Walmart outage today: After Microsoft disruption, payroll, HR services affected in 11,500 businesses as Workday goes down]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspa