imesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135790220.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A recent legal battle over Lamar DeLoach's estate concluded with the Court of Appeals affirming his 2003 will. Frank DeLoach argued that he had destroyed a later version, but the court ruled that, without a valid 2012 will, the original remains in effect. Court-appointed co-executors Larry and Rodney DeLoach are tasked with estate management, highlighting the critical nature of adhering to proper legal procedures in will creation and revocation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-mississippi-man-said-his-brother-destroyed-a-newer-will-before-dying-which-would-leave-him-the-entire-estate-a-november-10-appeals-court-upheld-the-signed-2003-will-instead-leaving-most-of-the-estate-to-cousins/articleshow/135790220.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-mississippi-man-said-his-brother-destroyed-a-newer-will-before-dying-which-would-leave-him-the-entire-estate-a-november-10-appeals-court-upheld-the-signed-2003-will-instead-leaving-most-of-the-estate-to-cousins/articleshow/135790220.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T19:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135790503,imgsize-144026.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ford turns former Amazon warehouse into home for 125 historic cars]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135833380.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Ford has converted a former Amazon fulfilment centre in Romulus, Michigan, into a 79,000-square-foot archive housing 125 historic vehicles. The collection includes the 1966 Le Mans winners, a rare Mustang prototype and a car from The Mary Tyler Moore Show. The facility will also help Ford designers and engineers study the company's automotive history.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-former-amazon-warehouse-in-michigan-now-holds-125-of-fords-historic-cars-from-rare-le-mans-racers-to-hollywood-mustangs-the-79000-square-foot-vault-will-welcome-its-first-visitors-on-november-14/articleshow/135833380.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-former-amazon-warehouse-in-michigan-now-holds-125-of-fords-historic-cars-from-rare-le-mans-racers-to-hollywood-mustangs-the-79000-square-foot-vault-will-welcome-its-first-visitors-on-november-14/articleshow/135833380.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T18:58:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135833676,imgsize-170710.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Historic Niagara Falls power station to become C$350 million luxury hotel]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135829774.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-power-station-built-beside-niagara-falls-in-1906-stopped-generating-electricity-in-1974-after-more-than-50-years-construction-has-begun-on-a-c350-million-plan-to-turn-it-into-a-five-star-hotel/articleshow/135829774.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-power-station-built-beside-niagara-falls-in-1906-stopped-generating-electricity-in-1974-after-more-than-50-years-construction-has-begun-on-a-c350-million-plan-to-turn-it-into-a-five-star-hotel/articleshow/135829774.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T18:56:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135829917,imgsize-764061.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Beavers were last recorded around Loch Ness in about 1527; nearly 500 years later, Scotland has licensed conservation groups to release up to 15 beaver families into the River Ness catchment over three years.]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135626919.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Scotland has approved a three-year project to reintroduce beavers to the River Ness catchment. Conservation organizations will relocate beaver families from other parts of Scotland to promote healthy populations. Beavers are recognized as ecosystem engineers that contribute to the restoration of natural habitats. Their return aims to improve ecological balance and support diverse wildlife in the region.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/beavers-were-last-recorded-around-loch-ness-in-about-1527-nearly-500-years-later-scotland-has-licensed-conservation-groups-to-release-up-to-15-beaver-families-into-the-river-ness-catchment-over-three-years-/articleshow/135626919.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/beavers-were-last-recorded-around-loch-ness-in-about-1527-nearly-500-years-later-scotland-has-licensed-conservation-groups-to-release-up-to-15-beaver-families-into-the-river-ness-catchment-over-three-years-/articleshow/135626919.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T18:54:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135628993,imgsize-2443668.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Why did a Brooklyn building collapse suddenly, killing eight? Experts point to excavation work at neighbouring construction site]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135833971.cms" /&